## SCSS / Sass — VS Dark+ (Smax)
syntax scss "\.s[ac]ss$"
comment "//"

## At-rules  @mixin @include @if @each @function @use @media ...
color #c8c "@[A-Za-z-]+"

## SCSS variables  $var  and CSS custom properties  --var
color #9df "\$[A-Za-z_-][A-Za-z0-9_-]*"
color #9df "\-\-[A-Za-z_-][A-Za-z0-9_-]*"

## Property names  foo:
color #9df "\<[A-Za-z-]+[[:space:]]*:"

## Selectors  #id  .class  &  %placeholder
color #dda "[.#%&][A-Za-z_-][A-Za-z0-9_-]*"

## Numbers with units
color #bca "\<[0-9]+\.?[0-9]*(px|em|rem|ex|ch|vw|vh|vmin|vmax|%|pt|pc|cm|mm|in|deg|rad|turn|s|ms|fr|dpi)?\>"

## Hex colours
color #c97 "#[0-9A-Fa-f]{3,8}\>"

## Functions  name(
color #dda "[A-Za-z_-]+[[:space:]]*(\()"

## Flags  !important !default !global
color #c8c "![A-Za-z]+"

## Strings
color #c97 ""[^"]*"|'[^']*'"

## Comments
color #6a5 "(^|[[:blank:]])//.*"
color #6a5 start="/\*" end="\*/"
